  "details": "On a completely fresh installation of the VRChat development environment (VCC, Unity, VS) on multiple, independent machines, the Unity Editor fails to correctly display UdonSharp script components. Although the UdonSharp compiler reports a successful compilation in the console, the Inspector window does not update to show the script's public variables. This makes it impossible to assign scene objects to script variables, fundamentally blocking the standard UdonSharp development workflow.",
